{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಯೋಬನು","commonName":"ಯೋಬನು","title":"ಯೋಬನು","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"43107c035650de184c8120657dd44425eb19810043d8df6a718725500a8bf994","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1070},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಬಿಲ್ದದನು ಯೋಬನಿಗೆ ನೀಡಿದ ಮೂರನೆಯ ಪ್ರತ್ಯುತ್ತರ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ಆ ಮೇಲೆ ಶೂಹ್ಯನಾದ ಬಿಲ್ದದನು ಹೀಗೆಂದನು,"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“ಆತನಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರಭುತ್ವವೂ ಭೀಕರತ್ವವೂ ಉಂಟು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ತನ್ನ ಉನ್ನತ ಲೋಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಸಮಾಧಾನವನ್ನು ಸ್ಥಾಪಿಸಿದವನು ಆತನೇ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಸೈನ್ಯಗಳಿಗೆ ಲೆಕ್ಕವಿದೆಯೋ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ತೇಜಸ್ಸು ಯಾರಲ್ಲಿಯೂ ಮೂಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಮನುಷ್ಯನು ದೇವರ ಎಣಿಕೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನೀತಿವಂತನಾಗಿರುವುದು ಹೇಗೆ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಮಾನವನಾಗಿ ಹುಟ್ಟಿದವನು ಪರಿಶುದ್ಧನಾಗಿರುವುದು ಸಾಧ್ಯವೋ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನೋಡಿರಿ, ಆತನ ದೃಷ್ಟಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಚಂದ್ರನಿಗಾದರೂ ಕಳೆಯಿಲ್ಲ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಕ್ಷತ್ರಗಳೂ ಶುದ್ಧವಲ್ಲ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಹೀಗಿರುವಲ್ಲಿ ನರಹುಳವು ಅಶುದ್ಧವಾದದ್ದು!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನರಕ್ರಿಮಿಯು ಎಷ್ಟೋ ಅಪವಿತ್ರವಾಗಿದ್ದಾನೆ!”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/JOB/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/JOB/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/JOB/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}